"}, {"text": "Qualities of a Good Manager\n</br></br>There are six skills that are essential for anyone who manages people or projects. Five of these six skills are people skills. People skills involve being able to communicate effectively in a friendly way.</br>As a manager, your communication style ought to be consistent, clear and tactful. You should use the appropriate words to communicate your ideas, requests and concerns and encourage the same in your staff. It is said that effective communication skills are at the root of excellent management.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn11le06ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Assertiveness is claimed to be an important key skill for managers. You ought to be able to communicate your ideas in a confident way without hesitating. It's possible to be assertive while also respecting the other person's viewpoint.</br>It is assumed that the natural ability to connect with others and build trust is a vital management skill. Excellent managers should be open, friendly, and easy-going with others, especially with members of their team. They ought to be able to interact with others in an informal but professional manner. Good managers should take an interest in their employees and show that they are invested in their growth and success.", "id": 2, "time": "30700", "image": "engenn11le06ob01re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "A relationship built on trust is vital. A manager should be explicit with expectations and plans and follow through with actions. A good manager is known to individually consider each employee and try to match their talents and interests with their tasks and compensation.</br>Being a good manager is a bit like putting together a puzzle. It is assumed that employees, tasks and goals are the puzzle pieces. Putting the puzzle together efficiently involves distributing tasks, coming up with strategies, overseeing the execution of it all, and providing constructive feedback.\nIt is understood that being a good manager and incorporating all six of the skills requires a lot of hard work and dedication.", "id": 3, "time": "65000", "image": "engenn11le06ob01re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le06ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le06ob01re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}